<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-20T07:48:38.457Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:48:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq is coping with security gaps after the complete US troop withdrawal as Baghdad and Tehran activate joint security committees and discuss stronger ties. Iran-backed Iraqi militias have pledged to defend Iran if attacked, while Iraqi authorities are pursuing legal action against media incitement supporting pro-Iran armed groups and have arrested a lawyer who brandished a gun in court. The Shingal mayoral post, vacant for nine years, is now open for nominations, and Jordan's king reaffirmed support for regional sovereignty and security. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5vNWZWLXZUelN5UkwtNjE3NFdmS3R4QlVLeDBpamtiT2RqbnZwbVgtT0t0VDROczQ3YUwzeUptNHU2WVF5Ri1EYUF1ZGVaWGt2MUhkMklpMVM0TE1fUUZUU2F4Y3JhVjIxV0hKU08wb0F3aHF4bThYYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNUjZoclRLVTlObk1aWTlscEhLSnZyOURudDUxd1plSEJRS2Roc3dRYjdqaVB0TWVPaHVodlZ1RmVESE1ZbXRxVlVpYUZwbmFScF84am02N1RCSERCUkQ2ZFQzX2ZuTXZfVjk0ZTdjMmcydUw2RkV4VVFjR3lObXdsNGZMb2lNcHp5ek1FNVM1dWMtOTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPSmNrWTFFN2lLR1VlNkozckJlRlZzQVlHVFA4NEpFaEJkOE1BS2NvVDl5UW01MUc5Unp3U1dVWTU4XzVlNFFQdmVORm1DVEYzYzBkeEgtMHdpLVc0SVBGQl9JeWtoU2VNbVNudzZ0dDdMZ0RxQjJpdHlCanpXeFEtUDBhZVN1WlM4VlkyTHA3TldNZEhReXZudXVBR2dRWkh3eFJNdFhDLXhYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObEE4RzFoX1ZjeXBqa2NsSjhCWnNJb0p3NDg2TlFIdTJYOVVZSWE5LUdCb09ta2dDaTRlMTRtODVSMHc2ZnhsMjA1bFBjYWpDQUdaQldRUU52QjVHckpEUml3Rl9EUzRjRTdacktTOE84Sm15MEJxcjRxMDNyOGlyYXFpN0s0bjFOazZkZ2l0bUhyWGdqRkNRdFhsLTU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo